autobackup
----------
- Source:   https://github.com/MMCISAGOODMAN/autobackup
- Version:  v1.1.0
- License:  MIT
- Usage:    The disaster recovery / backup module (modules/disaster_recovery/)
            vendors the single-file engine `autobackup.py` **in-process** to drive
            MySQL / PostgreSQL / file backups, cron scheduling, retention cleanup
            and webhook notifications. No sidecar service is started.
- Location: modules/disaster_recovery/vendor/autobackup.py

